{"3757020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLOKES on BLOCKS!", "steam_appid": 3757020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Step Can Change Everything!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOKES on BLOCKS!</strong> is a party action game with simple controls that anyone can pick up and enjoy right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players battle on the stage, bump into each other, and aim to win by knocking their opponents out of the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique stage gimmicks and unpredictable items bring chaos and excitement to every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes down to timing and mind games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your opponents one block at a time and be the last one standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer supports up to 4 players, making it a perfect game to enjoy with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online matches support up to 6 players via room creation and password sharing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also supports Steam Remote Play Together, so if the host owns the game, they can invite friends online and enjoy it together just like a local match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the directional pad to move up, down, left, or right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will automatically perform actions depending on the terrain ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries about ledges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most out-of-shape bloke can climb a one-block height with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Attack by Moving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move into a space occupied by another player, you’ll knock them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the opponent is already downed, your attack will send them flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking hits increases your damage count making you easier to launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your damage gauge near your feet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Comebacks Are a Strategy Too</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting knocked out of the arena isn’t the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, respawning is an opportunity to counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a flashy return and let everyone know you’re not the type to go down easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ll be waiting for you on top of the blocks, with a bunch of quirky ol' blokes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/93b79344c8641dab33925cd247387da7.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Step Can Change Everything!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.poster.avif?t=1773028805\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.webm?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757020/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.mp4?t=1773028805\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOKES on BLOCKS!</strong> is a party action game with simple controls that anyone can pick up and enjoy right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players battle on the stage, bump into 